:29.126" end="00:29.379">my </span><span begin="00:29.379" end="00:30.942">lullaby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.449" end="00:35.988"><span begin="00:31.449" end="00:34.121">Sometimes </span><span begin="00:34.121" end="00:34.471">I </span><span begin="00:34.471" end="00:35.128">drive </span><span begin="00:35.128" end="00:35.634">so </span><span begin="00:35.634" end="00:35.979">fast</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.351" end="00:39.520"><span begin="00:37.351" end="00:37.903">Just </span><span begin="00:37.903" end="00:38.259">to </span><span begin="00:38.259" end="00:38.510">feel </span><span begin="00:38.510" end="00:38.862">the </span><span begin="00:38.862" end="00:39.517">danger</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.134" end="00:42.646"><span begin="00:41.134" end="00:41.686">I </span><span begin="00:41.686" end="00:42.091">wanna </span><span begin="00:42.091" end="00:42.644">scream</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.898" end="00:44.965"><span begin="00:42.898" end="00:43.400">It </span><span begin="00:43.400" end="00:43.653">makes </span><span begin="00:43.653" end="00:44.008">me </span><span begin="00:44.008" end="00:44.409">feel </span><span begin="00:44.409" end="00:44.964">alive</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.189" end="00:49.717"><span begin="00:46.189" end="00:46.690">Is </span><span begin="00:46.690" end="00:46.994">it </span><span begin="00:46.994" end="00:48.202">enough </span><span begin="00:48.202" end="00:48.607">to </span><span begin="00:48.607" end="00:49.712">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.925" end="00:53.599"><span begin="00:49.925" end="00:50.726">Is </span><span begin="00:50.726" end="00:50.977">it </span><span begin="00:50.977" end="00:52.137">enough </span><span begin="00:52.137" end="00:52.538">to </span><span begin="00:52.538" end="00:53.593">breath</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.954" end="00:57.131"><span begin="00:53.954" end="00:54.508">Somebody </span><span begin="00:54.50